2026-10-13T18:22:09.9762890Z [warning] [Operator] The instance-operator allowlist is UNSET (BARKPARK_OPERATOR_EMAILS and BARKPARK_OPERATOR_TOKEN_IDS are
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9764527Z both empty), so the `admin` permission alone still opens these eight INSTANCE-GLOBAL
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9765845Z route groups to ANY admin-permissioned token, including one whose only membership is an
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9766927Z admin seat in a single workspace:
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9767862Z   1. POST|GET /v1/admin/self-update, POST /v1/admin/rollback, POST|GET /v1/admin/site-deploy
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9768634Z   2. GET /v1/plugins
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9769247Z   3. GET|PUT|DELETE /v1/plugins/settings/:plugin_name
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9770109Z   4. GET /v1/secrets, GET /v1/secrets/:name, GET /v1/secrets/:name/audit,
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9770968Z      PUT /v1/secrets/:name, DELETE /v1/secrets/:name
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9771796Z   5. POST /v1/status/incidents, POST /v1/status/incidents/:id/resolve
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9772448Z   6. POST /api/playground
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9773024Z   7. POST /api/workspaces/:workspace_slug/import
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9773754Z   8. GET /v1/instance/site-deploy, GET /v1/instance/metrics
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9774875Z On a SINGLE-TENANT instance that is fine — the only admin is the operator. On a
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9776015Z MULTI-TENANT one it hands your first customer-admin the instance: run-secrets in
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9777330Z cleartext, the instance-wide plugin credentials record, and the release itself.
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9778575Z Set BARKPARK_OPERATOR_EMAILS (comma-separated operator emails) and/or BARKPARK_OPERATOR_TOKEN_IDS
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9779852Z (comma-separated api_token ids) to arm the allowlist; once either is non-empty the
2026-10-13T18:22:09.9780733Z eight groups are allowlist-only and fail closed.
