4d518ff", "2eca95f6-acd2-4aa6-bdf8-2de7a9b15755", "ISBN-13", "13-character ISBN of a manifestation of work, when this is the only work identifier available (13 digits, without spaces or hyphens)", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.310870Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.310870Z], "8c861ea4-0be3-418f-8f97-97e59e7f6296", "e7675c96-48ae-49b9-bea4-a9df1b7f652c", "ISRC", "International Standard Recording Code", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.310870Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.310870Z], "2aa5ef3f-d77e-40e4-99c8-81786659ba0b", "bb974b5e-98f8-4724-bd45-87999fc9c3ce", "EIDR Content ID", "Entertainment Identifier Registry identifier for an audiovisual work, eg a movie, TV series (a DOI beginning ‘10.5240/’ with a suffix of 21 hexadecimal digits and five hyphens, and without https://doi.org/ or the older http://dx.doi.org/). See ui.eidr.org/search. Only for use in ONIX 3.0 or later", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.310870Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.310870Z], "77a561b8-beef-4ad6-b785-d0cde2d391e2", "260fcb0c-243b-47da-ba1e-8199535504c1", ...]
