which it is presented or packaged for retail sale", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.472337Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.472337Z], "e046909b-e7d0-4364-89db-fb69a59be183", "ef72a339-c959-45af-8cb2-1b07ac270edd", "Thickness", "For a book, the overall thickness of the spine. For a folded map, the thickness when folded. For packaged products, the depth of the retail packaging, and for trade-only products, the depth of the trade packaging. In general, the thickness or depth of a product in the form in which it is presented or packaged for retail sale", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.472337Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.472337Z], "7e5c8e10-cfec-4f29-9cd4-00b2da098796", "f38d6a36-0d9f-4837-8a9f-8865d0b3187a", "Page trim height", "Overall height (code 01) is preferred for general use, as it includes the board overhang for hardbacks", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.472337Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.472337Z], "fe198641-5e0f-431f-8d76-2cf8d832bdcc", "edc8a44c-e38c-440a-bf2e-8d73c403e988", "Page trim width", "Overall width (code 02) is preferred for general use, as it includes the board overhang and spine thickness for hardbacks", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.472337Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.472337Z], "fd40fe34-554c-4738-aad1-4732652036fd", "9654191e-6c44-439e-a8ff-a392f84f78bc", "Unit volume", "The volume of the product, including any retail packaging. Note the <MeasureUnit> is interpreted as a volumetric unit – for example code cm = cubic centimetres (ie millilitres), and code oz = (US) fluid ounces. Only for use in ONIX 3.0 or later", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.472337Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:22:11.472337Z], "35542e58-b1ff-4796-8a78-2210df516b8e", "a95cd0a3-7525-4d71-99d9-5a61dab1baa7", "Unit capacity", "Volume of the internal (fluid) contents of a product (eg of paint in a can). Note the <MeasureUnit> is interpreted as a volumetric unit – for example code cm = cubic centimetres (ie millilitres), and code oz = (US) fluid ounces. Only for use in ONIX 3.0 or later", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18: